    {"id":"SC09-S004","pieces":[["Wir hätten gerne eine Flasche Sprudelwasser","We'd like one bottle of sparkling water"],["und eine Flasche stilles Wasser, bitte.","and one bottle of still water, please."]]},
    {"id":"SC09-S005","pieces":[["Entschuldigung — haben Sie etwas Glutenfreies?","Excuse me - do you have anything gluten-free?"],["Oder für Vegetarier?","Or for vegetarians?"]]},
