    {"id":"SC10-S001","pieces":[["Entschuldigung.","Excuse me."],["Haben Sie Schmerzmittel?","Do you have any painkillers?"]]},
    {"id":"SC10-S002","pieces":[["Ja, die sind dort in dem Gang,","Yes, they're down that aisle,"],["auf der linken Seite.","on the left."]]},
    {"id":"SC10-S003","pieces":[["Danke.","Thank you."],["Und haben Sie auch Schmerzmittel für Kinder?","And do you have any painkillers for children?"]]},
    {"id":"SC10-S004","pieces":[["Ich glaube schon,","I think so,"],["aber Sie müssen nachschauen, um sicherzugehen.","but you'll have to look to make sure."]]},
    {"id":"SC10-S005","pieces":[["Ich brauche auch","I also need to get"],["Sonnencreme","some sunscreen"],["und Zahnpasta.","and some toothpaste."]]},
    {"id":"SC10-S006","pieces":[["Sonnencreme ist dort hinten auf Ihrer rechten Seite,","Sunscreen is down there on your right,"],["und Zahnpasta finden Sie gleich um die Ecke.","and you'll find toothpaste just round the corner."]]},
    {"id":"SC10-S007","pieces":[["Danke, Sie waren sehr hilfreich.","Thank you, you've been very helpful."],["Ich bin sehr dankbar.","I'm very grateful."]]},
